/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (Matching Point is a retail garment and matching accessories store located at Powerhouse Road, Maripur, Muzaffarpur, Bihar. Established in 2014, the business sells sarees, suit pieces, dupattas, blouse materials, and other matching accessories. The store currently maintains sales and inventory records manually, leading to two major operational challenges: locked working capital due to slow-moving inventory and high inventory holding costs caused by overstocking and stock imbalance.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
