/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (The analysis applied Descriptive Statistics, Pivot Table Analysis, and Inventory Status Classification to examine sales performance and stock behaviour. Preliminary findings show Dupatta as the highest-selling product by quantity, while Suit Piece generates the highest revenue. Inventory analysis reveals 50% of products at normal stock levels, 42.9% near stockout, and 7.1% overstocked. These insights will guide the ABC Analysis, Inventory Turnover Ratio, and Moving Average Forecasting planned for the final phase.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
