324 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 150 0 R
/E (Category-wise revenue analysis shows that Suit Piece, Saree, and Dupatta generate the highest revenue and should receive higher inventory priority. Inventory Status Distribution indicates that 42.9% of products are close to stockout while only 7.1% are overstocked. The comparison between Quantity Sold and Closing Stock identifies categories where inventory investment is higher than demand. These findings indicate that capital is currently blocked in slow-moving inventory while fast-moving products require timely replenishment. Better inventory prioritization using ABC Analysis can significantly improve working capital utilization.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
