/Title (Descriptive statistics are used to summarize the main characteristics of the collected dataset. They provide a clear understanding of sales performance by presenting numerical measures such as mean, median, mode, minimum, maximum, and standard deviation. These measures help identify sales patterns, product demand, pricing behaviour, and variation in sales transactions. The results provide an initial understanding of the business and support further analysis related to inventory management and working capital optimization.)
